# NOTE: assets/data/portal-data.json IS committed on purpose.
# It is the offline fallback the site uses if the Apps Script service is
# unreachable, and it is generated by export_json.py — never hand-edited.
# It contains no drafts and no unpublished posts; export_json.py withholds them.
